---

BlastRadius reports on the privileges held by credentials it finds. It is a
diagnostic aid, not a security audit. It reports what each provider's own API
discloses, and states plainly where it cannot determine something. A report
showing no findings means nothing matched the providers it ships — not that no
risk is present. Risk may remain in setups, environments and infrastructure
the tool cannot inspect.

